{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"歷代志上","commonName":"歷代志上","title":"歷代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"2f94c34a21c96afb2fa5dd31e916ecbe47a93a65b505dad02727f81d295816f4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":938},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["掃羅之死"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["非利士人與以色列人交戰，以色列人敗逃，許多人在基利波山被殺。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["非利士人窮追掃羅及其眾子，殺了掃羅的兒子約拿單、亞比拿達和麥基舒亞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["掃羅周圍戰事激烈，他被弓箭手發現後射成重傷，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["就對為他拿兵器的人說：「拔出你的刀來刺死我吧！免得那些未受割禮的人來凌辱我。」但拿兵器的人非常害怕，不敢動手，掃羅就拿起刀來，伏刀自盡了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["拿兵器的人看見掃羅已死，也伏刀自盡了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["這樣，掃羅和他三個兒子及全家都死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["住在山谷中的以色列人見以色列軍敗逃、掃羅及其眾子已死，都棄城而逃。於是，非利士人佔據了那些城邑。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["次日，非利士人來剝陣亡者的衣物，發現掃羅及其眾子橫屍基利波山，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["就剝下掃羅的盔甲，割下他的頭顱，並派人去非利士全境向他們的偶像和民眾通告消息。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他們把掃羅的盔甲放在他們的神廟裡，把他的頭顱掛在大袞神廟中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["基列·雅比人聽見非利士人對掃羅的所作所為，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他們所有的勇士就去把掃羅和他兒子們的屍體運到雅比，葬在雅比的橡樹下，並禁食七天。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["掃羅死了，因為他對耶和華不忠，不聽從祂的教誨，甚至去求問靈媒，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["而不求問耶和華。因此，耶和華使他被殺，把王位交給了耶西的兒子大衛。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}